OL,3,GNEWSASaints cancel memorial wall for
OL,4,Afans' ashes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA memorial wall that would have
OL,7,Fincluded the ashes of Northampton
OL,8,FSaints rugby fans has been cancelled.
OL,10,FThe Saints Memorial Wall was planned as
OL,11,Fpart of a wider development to enhance
OL,12,Fthe fan village at the Prem Rugby
OL,13,Fside's Franklin's Gardens ground.
OL,15,FHowever, the club said initial demand
OL,16,F"was not sufficient to support the
OL,17,Flong-term viability of the
OL,18,Fdevelopment".
OL,20,FSupporters who have already paid will
OL,21,Freceive a refund, Saints said.
